<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLJA0A1124044" svcinfotypenbr = "06" svcinfoqualnbr = "02" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
DTC P0500
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
There are two types of OBD system on ECM depending on the vehicle specification.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
For identification, refer to “Discrimination for OBD System” under 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1121003">OBD System Description:K12C</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1124044001">
<title>
DTC Detecting Condition and Trouble Area
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "4.607in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "2.571in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle" align = "center">
<ptxt>
DTC detecting condition
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Trouble area
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<ptxt>
<emph>
P0500: Vehicle Speed Sensor “A”
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Any of the following conditions is met.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Vehicle speed is slower than 4 km/h (2.5 mile/h) for 13 sec. at fuel cut.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Vehicle speed is not inputted by CAN communication.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic (type A))
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(2 D/C detection logic (type B))
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
CAN communication line
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Wheel speed sensor
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ECM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1124044002">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<attention1>
<ptxt>
If you do not select a suitable route and take proper precautions when performing a road test, an accident can occur.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Select a level road with no traffic to minimize the risk of accident.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the test extremely carefully.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the road test with 2 persons, a driver and a tester.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention1>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Troubleshoot first unexpected DTCs previously detected in “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that the following DTCs are not detected in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
ECT sensor (P0117)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
CKP sensor (P0335 and P0336)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine to normal operating temperature.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drive vehicle at 60 to 80 km/h (37 to 50 mile/h) constantly for 1 min. or more.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Release accelerator pedal, and keep vehicle coasting for 15 sec. with engine brakes applied (fuel cut condition).
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1124044003">
<title>
DTC Troubleshooting
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLJA0A1124044004">
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1124044005">
<question>
Was “Engine and Emission Control System Check” performed?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1124001">Engine and Emission Control System Check:K12C</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1124044006">
<title>
DTC check
</title>
<question>
Is there any CAN-DTC detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to troubleshooting for CAN-DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0AA824002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 3.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1124044007">
<title>
DTC check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check DTC in ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A4604005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is there any DTC(s) detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to troubleshooting for applicable DTC.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace ECM and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1326001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
